    "Name": "Arctic Fox",
    "Details": "Although this configuration was originally intended for underwater combat, the version replaced the five UMUs with jump jets. It uses a light PPC and Artemis IV-enhanced LRM-10 to engage the enemy. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.94</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
